MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1911762818}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9611985994d71404cbf0a3edd6be1137, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  storyText: {fileID: 77002524}
  nextButton: {fileID: 0}
  sceneToLoad: Main(prototype)
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  storyPages:
  - The heavy stone doors slammed shut behind us, sealing our fate. We are trapped
    in the Blackdeep Dungeon. My companions look to me for leadership the Mage, whose
    staff crackles with unstable arcane energy, and the Ranger, whose eyes are sharp
    enough to pierce the gloom. We no way back. The only way out... is forward.
  - "Our weapons felt heavy and useless against the shadows lurking here, until we
    found the Artifact. It speaks to us not in words, but in possibilities. It manifests
    our skills as Cards\u2014fragments of time and tactics woven into tangible power.
    With this deck in hand, every battle is a game of strategy, and every draw could
    mean the difference between life and death."
  - The enemies ahead are relentless, twisted by the dungeon's curse. But we are
    not defenseless. We must manage our strength, trust in the cards, and fight as
    one. The exit lies past the Guardian of the Depths. It is time to draw your weapon...
    and your hand. Our escape begins now.
  typingAudio: {fileID: 1025300618}
